OL,3,GNEWSAWe've been transatlantic pen pals
OL,4,Afor 70 years and are now more like
OL,5,Asisters
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo women who became transatlantic pen
OL,8,Fpals when they were in the Brownies say
OL,9,Fthey now feel "more like family",
OL,10,Fhaving written to each other regularly
OL,11,Ffor 70 years.
OL,13,FKathleen Bonthron (now Wilson) from
OL,14,FDrumchapel in Glasgow was 10 when her
OL,15,Fgroup leader gave her the Wisconsin
OL,16,Faddress for 11-year-old Shirley Hedtke
OL,17,F(now Yaeger) in 1956.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
