OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWe've been transatlantic pen pals
OL,4,Afor 70 years and are now more like
OL,5,Asisters
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe pair - now 80 and 81 - began
OL,8,Fwriting to each other and soon built up
OL,9,Fa rapport, with regular letters going
OL,10,Fback and forth between Scotland and the
OL,11,FUnited States.
OL,13,FThe girls kept in touch throughout
OL,14,Ftheir childhood, then their teenage
OL,15,Fyears, and as they settled down and had
OL,16,Ffamilies - and are still in contact now
OL,17,Fthey are pensioners.
